# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The local demo workspace's password — copy to `.env.demo` (make env does, if it is absent) and replace CHANGE_ME.
#   cp .env.demo.example .env.demo
# `.env.demo` is gitignored. Read ONLY by the demo commands (backend/bin/demo-seed.php, and the populate and walkthrough
# script), with Dotenv::parse() into a variable, never into the process environment; never printed. At least 12
# characters. Every demo person signs in with it. The demo commands run only on a database created with DB_PURPOSE=demo
# in .env.infra (then make reset). Alternatively pipe it in:
#   printf '%s' "<password>" | make demo-seed SEED_ARGS=--password-stdin
# Standing Rule 10: never paste a real value anywhere.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
DEMO_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_DEMO_PASSWORD
